          "text": "```java\npublic void testBug1864222() {\n    TimeSeries series = new TimeSeries(\"foo\", Day.class);\n    series.add(new Day(19, 4, 2005), 1);\n    series.add(new Day(25, 5, 2005), 1);\n    series.add(new Day(28, 5, 2005), 1);\n    series.add(new Day(30, 5, 2005), 1);\n    series.add(new Day(1, 6, 2005), 1);\n    series.add(new Day(3, 6, 2005), 1);\n    series.add(new Day(19, 8, 2005), 1);\n    series.add(new Day(31, 1, 2006), 1);\n\n    try {\n        // The requested range lies between existing observations.\n        TimeSeries copy = series.createCopy(\n                new Day(1, 12, 2005), new Day(18, 1, 2006));\n\n        assertNotNull(copy);\n        assertEquals(0, copy.getItemCount());\n        assertEquals(8, series.getItemCount());\n    } catch (CloneNotSupportedException e) {\n        fail(\"Unexpected CloneNotSupportedException: \" + e.getMessage());\n    }\n}\n```"
